<title>USA: Intercell completes buy of Avalon Tech.</title>
<headline>Intercell completes buy of Avalon Tech.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intercell Technologies Corp said Tuesday it completed its acquisition of Avalon Technology Inc for about $1 million in cash, notes and stock.</p>
<p>Last year, Avalon had sales of about $1.5 million.</p>
<p>Intercell Technologies said it will retain Avalon founder and current president Geraldine Bush as president of the newly acquired subsidiary.</p>
</text>
